window.ChatbotWissen={"sprachen":{"de":{"titel":"Piercing Akademie · Assistent","begruessung":"Hallo! Ich bin der automatische Assistent der Piercing Akademie. Frag mich zu Paketen und Preisen, zum Online-Kurs, zu den Praxistagen in Lingen, zu Pflege und Heilung oder wie du uns erreichst.","relativZu":"seite","vorschlaege":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Was ist der Praxistag?","Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","Wie melde ich mich an?","Kontakt"],"fallback":{"a":"Dazu habe ich leider keine Antwort. Schreib uns gern direkt: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com oder ruf an: +49 173 8072405.","links":[{"t":"Anfrage senden","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"E-Mail schreiben","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Anrufen","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Welche Module gibt es?","Kontakt"]},"faq":[{"id":"entzuendung","q":"Ist mein Piercing entzündet?","a":"Mögliche Anzeichen einer Entzündung oder Infektion sind zunehmende Schwellung, Schmerzen, Wärme, starke oder dunkle Rötung, Eiter (weiß, grün oder gelb) sowie Fieber, Schüttelfrost oder Krankheitsgefühl. Den Schmuck dann nicht selbst herausnehmen: Sonst kann sich die Öffnung schließen und die Entzündung einschließen. Rausnehmen nur, wenn eine Ärztin oder ein Arzt es sagt. Eine Infektion sollte zügig ärztlich behandelt werden. Juckreiz, Ausschlag oder Schwellung können auch auf eine allergische Reaktion hindeuten.\nIm Zweifel bitte ärztlich abklären lassen.","k":["entzündung","entzündet","infektion","infiziert","eiter","eitert","rötung","gerötet","heiß","warm","fieber","schüttelfrost","starke schmerzen","allergie","allergisch","allergische reaktion","ausschlag","juckt","juckreiz","wildes fleisch","beule","knubbel"],"links":[{"t":"Die Piercing Akademie","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","Wie lange heilt ein Piercing?"],"prio":true},{"id":"pflege","q":"Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","a":"Allgemeine Pflegeempfehlungen für ein frisches Piercing:\n- vor dem Anfassen die Hände waschen, sonst das Piercing möglichst in Ruhe lassen\n- bei Bedarf mit steriler Kochsalzlösung (Wundspüllösung aus der Apotheke) spülen und mit Einmal-Papier trocken tupfen\n- keinen Alkohol, kein Wasserstoffperoxid, keine antibakterielle Seife, kein Jod und keine Salben verwenden\n- Krusten nicht abkratzen, Schmuck nicht unnötig drehen oder damit spielen\n- während der Heilung Schwimmbad, Seen und Whirlpools meiden\n- Bettwäsche sauber halten; bei Ohrknorpel hilft ein Reisekissen oder ein frisches T-Shirt über dem Kissen\nIm Kurs geht es darum ausführlich in Modul 10 (Pflege und Wundheilstörungen).","k":["pflege","pflegen","pflegehinweise","reinigen","reinigung","säubern","sauber machen","kochsalz","kochsalzlösung","salzwasser","desinfizieren","desinfektion","alkohol","salbe","schwimmen","schwimmbad","sauna","nachsorge","frisches piercing","neues piercing","schlafen","drehen"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Wie lange heilt ein Piercing?","Ist mein Piercing entzündet?"]},{"id":"normal","q":"Normal?","a":"In den ersten Tagen sind leichte Blutung, Schwellung, Druckempfindlichkeit und blaue Flecken normal. Später können Juckreiz, eine leichte Verfärbung und eine weißlich-gelbe Flüssigkeit auftreten, die am Schmuck verkrustet. Das ist kein Eiter, sondern gehört zur Heilung. Ein Piercing heilt von außen nach innen: Auch wenn es sich gut anfühlt, ist das Gewebe innen noch empfindlich.","k":["normal","normal so","kruste","krusten","flüssigkeit","sekret","nässt","blau","bluterguss","geschwollen normal","heilung normal","wundsekret","gelb"],"next":["Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","Ist mein Piercing entzündet?"]},{"id":"heilung","q":"Wie lange heilt ein Piercing?","a":"Übliche Heilungszeiten (Richtwerte, individuell verschieden):\n- Ohrläppchen, Augenbraue, Lippe: 6 bis 8 Wochen\n- Ohrknorpel: 2 bis 4 Monate\n- Nase (Nasenflügel): 2 bis 8 Monate\n- Zunge und Mundinnenraum: 3 bis 6 Wochen\n- Bauchnabel: bis zu 9 Monate\n- Brustwarze und Intimbereich: 6 bis 12 Monate\nWährend der ganzen Heilungszeit weiter pflegen. Abheilzeiten sind auch Thema in Modul 10 des Kurses.","k":["heilt","heilen","heilung","abheilen","abgeheilt","abheilzeit","abheilzeiten","heilungszeit","wie lange","dauert","verheilt","schmuck wechseln","wechseln"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","Ist mein Piercing entzündet?"]},{"id":"schmerz","q":"Tut Piercen weh?","a":"Wie stark ein Stich wehtut, ist von Person und Körperstelle abhängig. Im Kurs geht es darum in Modul 04 „Schmerz und Betäubung“: wie Schmerz entsteht und weitergeleitet wird, Lokalanästhesie und ihre Grenzen, Eisspray und Lidocainsalbe mit Nebenwirkungen und Wechselwirkungen.","k":["weh","tut weh","schmerz","schmerzen","schmerzhaft","betäubung","betäuben","lidocain","eisspray","emla"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"material","q":"Welcher Schmuck, welches Material?","a":"Laut Seite gilt: Ersteinsatz nur aus Titan G23 oder PTFE. Im Kurs behandelt Modul 06 „Material und Schmuck“ unter anderem Titan G23, Blackline und Zirkon, Gold, Chirurgenstahl, Nickelallergie erkennen, PTFE, Schmuckformen und Überlänge beim Ersteinsatz.","k":["schmuck","material","titan","chirurgenstahl","stahl","gold","nickel","nickelallergie","ptfe","ersteinsatz","ring","stecker","labret","barbell"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Wie pflege ich ein frisches Piercing?","Welche Module gibt es?"]},{"id":"pakete","q":"Welche Pakete gibt es?","a":"Es gibt drei Pakete:\n- Basis (Online-Kurs): 249 € inkl. MwSt. Erst das Wissen, oder du arbeitest schon im Studio.\n- Praxis (Online-Kurs + Praxistag): 999 € inkl. MwSt. Piercen wirklich lernen, am Menschen. Unsere Empfehlung.\n- Komplett (Mit 1:1-Coaching): 2.490 € inkl. MwSt. Persönlich begleitet, bis du sicher arbeitest. Zunächst 10 Plätze.\nAlle Preise sind Endpreise in Euro inkl. MwSt.","k":["paket","pakete","preis","preise","kosten","kostet","euro","angebot","angebote","tarif","teuer","günstig"],"links":[{"t":"Pakete ansehen","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Basis","Praxis","Komplett","Kursbuch"]},{"id":"p-basis","q":"Paket Basis","a":"Paket Basis (Online-Kurs): 249 € inkl. MwSt\nErst das Wissen, oder du arbeitest schon im Studio.\n- Alle 11 Module\n- Fragen, Checklisten, Abschlusstest\n- Kursbuch als Grundlage\n- Teilnahmebescheinigung\n- Praxisaufgaben mit Materialliste und Kauflinks","k":["Basis","paket Basis","kostet","kosten","preis","nur online","nur theorie","einsteiger"],"links":[{"t":"Basis anfragen","h":"index.html?paket=basis#kontakt"},{"t":"Alle Pakete","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Was ist der Praxistag?","Wie melde ich mich an?"]},{"id":"p-praxis","q":"Paket Praxis","a":"Paket Praxis (Online-Kurs + Praxistag): 999 € inkl. MwSt\nPiercen wirklich lernen, am Menschen.\n- Alles aus Basis\n- 1 Praxistag in Lingen\n- Echte Modelle","k":["Praxis","paket Praxis","kostet","kosten","preis","empfehlung"],"links":[{"t":"Praxis anfragen","h":"index.html?paket=praxis#kontakt"},{"t":"Alle Pakete","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Was ist der Praxistag?","Wie melde ich mich an?"]},{"id":"p-komplett","q":"Paket Komplett","a":"Paket Komplett (Mit 1:1-Coaching): 2.490 € inkl. MwSt\nPersönlich begleitet, bis du sicher arbeitest. Zunächst 10 Plätze.\n- Alles aus Praxis\n- 1:1-Coaching\n- 2 Praxistage in Lingen\n- Übungsmaterial für zu Hause, per Post\n- 12 Monate Support","k":["Komplett","paket Komplett","kostet","kosten","preis","coaching","1 1 coaching","support","übungsmaterial"],"links":[{"t":"Komplett anfragen","h":"index.html?paket=komplett#kontakt"},{"t":"Alle Pakete","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Was ist der Praxistag?","Wie melde ich mich an?"]},{"id":"kursbuch","q":"Kursbuch","a":"Das Kursbuch gibt es auch einzeln:\n- Kursbuch digital: 19,90 € inkl. MwSt. „Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer“. In jedem Kurspaket enthalten. 120 Seiten, von Hygiene bis Datenblatt, Online lesen, mit Suche und Notizen.\n- Kursbuch Softcover: 39,99 € inkl. MwSt. Dasselbe Kursbuch als Taschenbuch. Bestellung und Versand über Amazon. 120 Seiten, Softcover, epubli, 2024, ISBN 978-3-8187-5668-0, Zum Mitnehmen ins Studio.\nDas Kursbuch „Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer“ von Alessandro Noto ist in jedem Paket dabei.","k":["kursbuch","buch","bücher","fachbuch","softcover","taschenbuch","digital","ebook","e book","amazon","isbn","lesen","bodypiercer"],"links":[{"t":"Kursbuch digital anfragen","h":"index.html?paket=buch#kontakt"},{"t":"Softcover bei Amazon","h":"https://www.amazon.de/dp/3818756686"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"praxistag","q":"Was ist der Praxistag?","a":"Der Praxistag ist ein Tag im Studio in Lingen (Ems). Du stichst so viele verschiedene Piercings wie möglich, immer unter Anleitung. Modelle bringst du mit, oder das Studio sucht welche für dich. Garantieren können wir das nicht.\nTermine: Termine nach Absprache.\nSicherheit zuerst. Jedes Modell ist volljährig und unterschreibt vorab. Gearbeitet wird nach dem Hygieneplan des Studios.\nTechnik ersetzt keine Anleitung. Der Online-Kurs vermittelt das Wissen, gestochen wird erst hier, unter Aufsicht. Steche nach dem Online-Kurs niemanden allein.\nAblauf:\n- Hygiene und Vorbereitung: Händedesinfektion, Arbeitsplatz, Instrumente.\n- Gespräch und Einverständnis: Wünsche klären, Ängste nehmen.\n- Stelle prüfen und anzeichnen: Ersteinsatz wählen, Ein- und Austritt markieren.\n- Der Stich unter Anleitung: Klemme setzen, Kanüle führen, Schmuck einsetzen.\n- Nachsorge und Pflege: Pflegehinweise mündlich und schriftlich.\nPraxistage gibt es in den Paketen Praxis (1 Praxistag) und Komplett (2 Praxistage).","k":["praxistag","praxistage","praxis tag","studio","lingen","vor ort","präsenz","echte modelle","modell","modelle","stechen","üben","termin","termine","wann","datum","ort","allein","alleine","aufsicht","anleitung"],"links":[{"t":"Zum Praxistag","h":"index.html#praxistag"},{"t":"Termin anfragen","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["Kann ich ein eigenes Modell zum Praxistag mitbringen?","Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"onlinekurs","q":"Wie funktioniert der Online-Kurs?","a":"Der Online-Kurs: Module: 11, Lektionen: 103, Fragen: 575, Zugang: 12 Monate.\nSo lernst du:\n- Erst der Stoff: Merksätze, Tabellen, Fotos aus dem Kursbuch und eigens gezeichnete Grafiken.\n- Dann die Fragen: Eine nach der anderen, mit sofortiger Rückmeldung. Falsche kommen wieder.\n- Dann die nächste Lektion: Sie öffnet sich erst, wenn alle Fragen sitzen.\n- Modulprüfung: 20 Zufallsfragen, bestanden ab 80 Prozent. Bei Hygiene und Notfällen ab 85 Prozent.\n- Fehler-Training: Alles, was du falsch hattest, kommt wieder, bis du es zweimal richtig beantwortet hast.\n- Prüfungssimulation: 50 Fragen aus allen Modulen. Bei Hygiene und Notfällen ist höchstens ein Fehler erlaubt.\n- Lernen, wo du willst: Auf Handy, Tablet oder Computer. Zugang 12 Monate ab Freischaltung.\n- Kursbuch dazu: Die Grundlage der Theorie, in jedem Paket enthalten.\n- Abschlusstest und Nachweis: Nach dem Abschlusstest bekommst du eine Teilnahmebescheinigung der Akademie. Kein staatlicher Abschluss.\nDer Online-Kurs ersetzt keine praktische Anleitung. Er vermittelt das Wissen. Gestochen wird erst am Praxistag, unter Aufsicht. Steche nach dem Online-Kurs niemanden allein.","k":["online kurs","onlinekurs","online","kurs","lernen","lektionen","prüfung","prüfungen","modulprüfung","abschlusstest","test","zugang","handy","tablet","computer","eigenes tempo","fahrschule","dauer"],"links":[{"t":"Zum Online-Kurs","h":"online-kurs.html"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"module","q":"Welche Module gibt es?","a":"Der Kurs hat 11 Module:\n- 01 Berufsbild und Geschichte\n- 02 Recht, Haftung, Einverständnis\n- 03 Anatomie, Haut und Wundheilung\n- 04 Schmerz und Betäubung\n- 05 Hygiene und steriles Arbeiten\n- 06 Material und Schmuck\n- 07 Werkzeuge und Instrumente\n- 08 Piercing-Arten\n- 09 Ablauf, Kundengespräch, Notfälle\n- 10 Pflege und Wundheilstörungen\n- 11 Studio starten\nNenn mir ein Thema oder eine Modulnummer, dann sage ich dir mehr.","k":["module","modul","kursinhalt","inhalt","inhalte","themen","thema","lehrplan"],"links":[{"t":"Alle Module","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Hygiene und steriles Arbeiten","Piercing-Arten","Studio starten"]},{"id":"m-01","q":"Modul 01: Berufsbild und Geschichte","a":"Modul 01: Berufsbild und Geschichte\nDu weißt, was Piercing ist, woher es kommt, wie heute professionell gestochen wird und warum die Ohrlochpistole nicht ins Studio gehört.\nLektionen:\n- Was Piercing ist\n- Die frühen Spuren: Afrika und Ägypten\n- Europa, Antike und andere Kulturen\n- Wie heute gestochen wird\n- Hygiene, Pflege und Abheilung\n- Warum keine Ohrlochpistole\n- Vorbereitung des Kunden\n7 Lektionen · 34 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 01","modul 1","Berufsbild und Geschichte","Berufsbild","Geschichte"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-02","q":"Modul 02: Recht, Haftung, Einverständnis","a":"Modul 02: Recht, Haftung, Einverständnis\nDu weißt, warum jedes Piercing eine Einwilligung braucht, was in die Einverständniserklärung gehört und welche Grenzen du als Piercer einhältst.\nLektionen:\n- Piercen ist eine Körperverletzung\n- Was das Strafgesetzbuch sagt\n- Haare, Haftung und Schadensersatz\n- Alter und Minderjährige\n- Die Einverständniserklärung aufbauen\n- Aufklärung über Komplikationen\n- Fotos und Datenschutz\n- Heilversprechen und Werbung\n8 Lektionen · 38 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 02","modul 2","Recht, Haftung, Einverständnis","Recht","Haftung","Einverständnis"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-03","q":"Modul 03: Anatomie, Haut und Wundheilung","a":"Modul 03: Anatomie, Haut und Wundheilung (neu, geht über das Kursbuch hinaus)\nDu verstehst, durch welche Gewebe ein Stichkanal führt, warum Knorpel langsamer heilt als ein Ohrläppchen und wo Gefäße und Nerven ein Risiko sind.\nLektionen:\n- Der Aufbau der Haut\n- Knorpel, Weichgewebe und Schleimhaut\n- Risikozonen im Gesicht\n- Nerven, Arterie und Speichelgang im Gesicht\n- Gefäße erkennen, Schwellkörper meiden\n- Die Phasen der Wundheilung\n- Wer schlechter heilt\n7 Lektionen · 41 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 03","modul 3","Anatomie, Haut und Wundheilung","Anatomie","Haut","Wundheilung"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-04","q":"Modul 04: Schmerz und Betäubung","a":"Modul 04: Schmerz und Betäubung\nDu verstehst, wie Schmerz entsteht und weitergeleitet wird, welche Betäubung du als Piercer einsetzen darfst und worauf du dabei achten musst.\nLektionen:\n- „Tut das weh?“\n- Schmerzrezeptoren und Reize\n- Wie Schmerz im Gewebe entsteht\n- Wie Schmerz ins Gehirn gelangt\n- Lokalanästhesie und ihre Grenzen\n- Eisspray und Lidocainsalbe\n- Nebenwirkungen von Lidocain\n- Wechselwirkungen von Lidocain\n- Lidocain sicher anwenden\n9 Lektionen · 47 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 04","modul 4","Schmerz und Betäubung","Schmerz","Betäubung"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-05","q":"Modul 05: Hygiene und steriles Arbeiten","a":"Modul 05: Hygiene und steriles Arbeiten\nDu arbeitest wie in einem OP: mit korrekter Händehygiene, sauber ausgestattetem Arbeitsplatz, richtiger Desinfektion, Rahmenhygieneplan und sicherer Sterilisation im Autoklav.\nLektionen:\n- Hygienemaßnahmen im Piercingraum\n- Ziele und Voraussetzungen der Händehygiene\n- Die hygienische Händedesinfektion\n- Die chirurgische Händedesinfektion\n- Waschen oder desinfizieren?\n- Die Händewaschung\n- Der Waschplatz\n- Der Arbeitsplatz\n- Nadelabwurf und Mundschutz\n- Schutz vor Blutkontakt: Impfung und Nadelstich\n- Desinfektion, Sterilisation und Antisepsis\n- Wie Desinfektionsmittel wirken\n- Arten von Desinfektionsmitteln und die VAH-Liste\n- Instrumente richtig behandeln\n- Der Rahmenhygieneplan\n- Der Autoklav\n- Besteck aufbereiten und verpacken\n- Die vier Phasen der Sterilisation\n- Lagerung und Funktionskontrolle\n19 Lektionen · 101 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 05","modul 5","Hygiene und steriles Arbeiten","Hygiene","steriles Arbeiten"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-06","q":"Modul 06: Material und Schmuck","a":"Modul 06: Material und Schmuck\nDu weißt, welche Materialien als Ersteinsatz in Frage kommen, erkennst die gängigen Schmuckformen und kennst die Grundregel zur Überlänge.\nLektionen:\n- Titan G23\n- Blackline und Zirkon Gold\n- Chirurgenstahl\n- Die Regel für den Ersteinsatz\n- Nickelallergie erkennen\n- PTFE\n- Woran du guten Ersteinsatz-Schmuck erkennst\n- Schmuckformen: Stäbe und Stecker\n- Schmuckformen: Ringe\n- Überlänge beim Ersteinsatz\n10 Lektionen · 48 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 06","modul 6","Material und Schmuck","Material","Schmuck"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-07","q":"Modul 07: Werkzeuge und Instrumente","a":"Modul 07: Werkzeuge und Instrumente\nDu kennst die Werkzeuge des Piercers, weißt, wofür du sie einsetzt, und unterscheidest, was steril sein muss und was nur sauber.\nLektionen:\n- Kanülen\n- Kanülenstärke und Schmuckstärke\n- Biopsiestanzen\n- Zangen, Klemmen und Nadelauffangrohr\n- Hilfswerkzeuge\n- Einmalmaterial\n- Steril oder nur sauber?\n7 Lektionen · 41 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 07","modul 7","Werkzeuge und Instrumente","Werkzeuge","Instrumente"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-08","q":"Modul 08: Piercing-Arten","a":"Modul 08: Piercing-Arten\nDu kennst für jedes Piercing Lage, Ersteinsatz, Kanüle und Klemme, und du weißt, welche Piercings du als Anfänger ablehnst oder grundsätzlich nicht durchführst.\nLektionen:\n- So liest du ein Datenblatt\n- Lobe und Upper Lobe\n- Tragus und Anti-Tragus\n- Helix, Industrial und Allergiepiercing\n- Conch und Snug\n- Rook und Daith\n- Nase: Nostril und Septum\n- Augenbraue und Bridge\n- Lippe: Labret, Medusa und Eskimo\n- Lippenbändchen und Zunge\n- Cheek\n- Bauchnabel\n- Brustwarze\n- Surface\n- Intimbereich Männer (nur für Volljährige)\n- Intimbereich Frauen (nur für Volljährige)\n- Diese Piercings führst du nicht durch\n17 Lektionen · 124 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 08","modul 8","Piercing-Arten","Piercing-Arten"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-09","q":"Modul 09: Ablauf, Kundengespräch, Notfälle","a":"Modul 09: Ablauf, Kundengespräch, Notfälle\nDu kennst den Ablauf vom Betreten des Studios bis zur Nachsorge in 26 Schritten und weißt, was du bei Kreislaufproblemen tust.\nLektionen:\n- Empfang und Kundengespräch\n- Vorbereitung und Anzeichnen\n- Der Stich\n- Schmuck sichern\n- Nachsorge und Abschluss\n- Kreislaufprobleme und Notfälle\n6 Lektionen · 49 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 09","modul 9","Ablauf, Kundengespräch, Notfälle","Ablauf","Kundengespräch","Notfälle"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-10","q":"Modul 10: Pflege und Wundheilstörungen","a":"Modul 10: Pflege und Wundheilstörungen\nDu gibst die richtigen Pflegehinweise, kennst die Abheilzeiten und erkennst Wundheilstörungen, bevor sie zum Problem werden.\nLektionen:\n- Pflege anleiten\n- Die richtigen Pflegemittel\n- Abheilzeiten\n- Fehlende Epithelisierung und Nachbluten\n- Entzündungen\n- Perichondritis: Notfall am Ohrknorpel\n- Wildes Fleisch\n7 Lektionen · 35 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 10","modul 10","Pflege und Wundheilstörungen","Pflege","Wundheilstörungen"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"m-11","q":"Modul 11: Studio starten","a":"Modul 11: Studio starten (neu, geht über das Kursbuch hinaus)\nDu weißt, welche Schritte vor dem Start deines eigenen Piercing-Angebots anstehen: Gewerbe, Gesundheitsamt, Hygieneplan, Dokumentation, Versicherung, Preise und Einkauf.\nLektionen:\n- Gewerbe und Behörden\n- Räume planen\n- Hygieneplan und Dokumentation\n- Versicherung und Preise\n- Einkauf\n- Regeln für dein Studio\n6 Lektionen · 17 Fragen · Modulprüfung","k":["modul 11","modul 11","Studio starten","Studio starten"],"links":[{"t":"Kursinhalt","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Welche Module gibt es?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"zertifikat","q":"Bekomme ich ein Zertifikat?","a":"Das Zertifikat der Piercing Akademie bestätigt deine Teilnahme und dein Training. Es ist kein staatlicher Abschluss.\nNach dem Abschlusstest des Online-Kurses bekommst du eine Teilnahmebescheinigung der Akademie.","k":["zertifikat","bescheinigung","teilnahmebescheinigung","abschluss","nachweis","urkunde","anerkannt","staatlich","ausbildung","qualifikation","zeugnis"],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Darf ich nach dem Kurs ein Studio eröffnen?"]},{"id":"zielgruppe","q":"Für wen ist der Kurs?","a":"Für alle, die professionell piercen wollen:\n- Kosmetikstudios: Piercing als neues Angebot, sicher und sauber.\n- Tattoostudios: Hygiene kennst du. Stichtechnik, Schmuck und Material kommen dazu.\n- Eigenes Studio: Vom ersten Stich bis zu Gewerbe, Hygieneplan und Einkauf.\nFür ein eigenes Studio passt am besten: Komplett.","k":["für wen","zielgruppe","kosmetikstudio","kosmetik","tattoostudio","tattoo","tätowierer","quereinsteiger","geeignet","passt"],"next":["Brauche ich Vorkenntnisse?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"ausbilder","q":"Wer ist der Ausbilder?","a":"Dein Ausbilder ist Alessandro Noto. „Ich bin Piercer und Inhaber von 740 Piercing in Lingen. In der Piercing Akademie zeige ich dir, wie ich im Studio jeden Tag arbeite: sauber, sicher und Schritt für Schritt.“\nJahre als Piercer: 5, gestochene Piercings: Tausende, eigenes Studio: Lingen.","k":["ausbilder","trainer","lehrer","dozent","alessandro","noto","740 piercing","erfahrung","über euch","über dich"],"links":[{"t":"Instagram @740_piercing","h":"https://www.instagram.com/740_piercing/"}],"next":["Kontakt"]},{"id":"leistung","q":"Was bekomme ich?","a":"Das bekommst du:\n- Wissen eines erfahrenen Piercers, von A bis Z\n- Ziel: danach selbstständig und sicher arbeiten\n- Einkaufstipps für Schmuck, Kanülen und Material\n- Klare Hygiene- und Rechtsgrundlagen\n- Übung am Silikon und am Modell, je nach Paket","k":["bekomme","bekommt","enthalten","inklusive","leistung","leistungen","mehrwert","lohnt"],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"faq-0","q":"Brauche ich Vorkenntnisse?","a":"Nein. Der Kurs beginnt bei den Grundlagen. Wenn du schon im Studio arbeitest, kannst du gezielt nacharbeiten.","k":["vorkenntnisse","vorwissen","ohne erfahrung","anfänger","neuling"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"faq-1","q":"Wie bekomme ich Zugang zum Online-Kurs?","a":"Nach der Buchung bekommst du deine Zugangsdaten per E-Mail. Du lernst im eigenen Tempo auf Handy, Tablet oder Computer.","k":["zugang","zugangsdaten","login","einloggen","freischaltung"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"faq-2","q":"Kann ich ein eigenes Modell zum Praxistag mitbringen?","a":"Ja. Das Modell muss volljährig sein und unterschreibt vorab eine Einverständniserklärung. Ohne eigenes Modell sucht das Studio eines für dich. Das klappt in der Regel, garantieren können wir es nicht.","k":["eigenes modell","modell mitbringen","mitbringen","freundin","freund","modelle"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"faq-3","q":"Wann finden die Praxistage statt?","a":"Nach Absprache. Schreib uns deinen Wunschzeitraum, wir finden gemeinsam einen Termin.","k":["wann","termine","praxistage stattfinden","datum","zeitraum"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"faq-4","q":"Darf ich nach dem Kurs ein Studio eröffnen?","a":"Das entscheiden Gewerbeamt und Gesundheitsamt vor Ort. Modul 11 zeigt dir, was du vorbereiten solltest.","k":["studio eröffnen","eröffnen","gewerbe","gesundheitsamt","gewerbeamt","selbstständig","erlaubnis","genehmigung"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"faq-5","q":"Was ist der Unterschied zwischen Praxis und Komplett?","a":"Komplett hat zusätzlich 1:1-Coaching, einen zweiten Praxistag, das komplette Übungsmaterial für zu Hause per Post und ein Jahr Support.","k":["unterschied","praxis oder komplett","praxis komplett","vergleich"],"links":[{"t":"Häufige Fragen","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"alter","q":"Ab welchem Alter?","a":"Die Teilnahme ist ab 18 Jahren möglich. Auch jedes Modell am Praxistag ist volljährig und unterschreibt vorab.","k":["alter","alt","jahre","minderjährig","volljährig","16","17","18","jugendlich"],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"anmeldung","q":"Wie melde ich mich an?","a":"Schick uns eine Anfrage. Den Termin für deinen Praxistag stimmen wir persönlich mit dir ab.\nÜber das Formular unter „Anmeldung“ wählst du dein Paket und schickst uns deine Anfrage. Du erreichst uns auch per Telefon (+49 173 8072405) oder E-Mail (diepiercingakademie@gmail.com).\nAlle Preise sind Endpreise in Euro inkl. MwSt.","k":["anmelden","anmeldung","melde","melden","einschreiben","buchen","buchung","bestellen","bestellung","platz","platz sichern","anfrage","registrieren","mitmachen","teilnehmen"],"links":[{"t":"Anfrage senden","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"E-Mail schreiben","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Anrufen","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"widerruf","q":"Widerruf und AGB","a":"Die Regeln zu Vertrag und Widerruf stehen in den AGB mit Widerrufsbelehrung. Auf der Seite heißt es dazu: „Teilnahme ab 18 Jahren. Der Online-Kurs startet sofort nach dem Kauf: Mit deiner Zustimmung im Bestellvorgang erlischt das Widerrufsrecht für den Online-Kurs mit der Freischaltung deines Zugangs.“\nEine rechtliche Beratung kann ich nicht geben. Bei Fragen wende dich bitte direkt an uns.","k":["widerruf","widerrufen","widerrufsrecht","stornieren","storno","kündigen","kündigung","rücktritt","geld zurück","erstattung","agb","vertrag"],"links":[{"t":"AGB und Widerruf","h":"agb.html#widerruf"},{"t":"Vertrag widerrufen","h":"widerrufen.html"}],"next":["Kontakt"]},{"id":"kontakt","q":"Kontakt","a":"Die Piercing Akademie\n740 Piercing, Burgstraße 12, 49808 Lingen (Ems)\nTelefon: +49 173 8072405\nE-Mail: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com\nInstagram: @diepiercingakademie","k":["kontakt","kontaktieren","erreichen","telefon","telefonnummer","anrufen","nummer","email","e mail","mail","adresse","anschrift","instagram","nachricht","schreiben","whatsapp","standort"],"links":[{"t":"Anfrage senden","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"E-Mail schreiben","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Anrufen","h":"tel:+491738072405"},{"t":"Instagram","h":"https://www.instagram.com/diepiercingakademie/"}],"next":["Wie melde ich mich an?","Welche Pakete gibt es?"]},{"id":"recht","q":"Impressum und Datenschutz","a":"Alle Pflichtangaben stehen im Impressum, alles zum Umgang mit deinen Daten in der Datenschutzerklärung.","k":["impressum","datenschutz","datenschutzerklärung","dsgvo","inhaber","betreiber","rechtliches"],"links":[{"t":"Impressum","h":"impressum.html"},{"t":"Datenschutz","h":"datenschutz.html"},{"t":"AGB und Widerruf","h":"agb.html"}],"next":["Kontakt"]},{"id":"bot","q":"Wer bist du?","a":"Ich bin ein automatischer Assistent. Ich laufe nur in deinem Browser, nutze keine Cookies und speichere oder versende deine Eingaben nicht. Ich antworte mit den Informationen dieser Webseite und allgemeinem Wissen, ersetze aber keine persönliche oder ärztliche Beratung und keine Rechtsberatung.","k":["wer bist du","bot","chatbot","assistent","ki","künstliche intelligenz","mensch","speichern","gespeichert","cookies"],"next":["Welche Pakete gibt es?","Kontakt"]},{"id":"danke","q":"Danke","a":"Gern! Wenn du noch etwas wissen möchtest, frag einfach.","k":["danke","dankeschön","super","perfekt","tschüss","ciao","bye"]}]},"en":{"titel":"Piercing Academy · Assistant","begruessung":"Hi! I am the automated assistant of the Piercing Academy. Ask me about packages and prices, the online course, the practice days in Lingen, aftercare and healing, or how to reach us.","relativZu":"seite","vorschlaege":["Which packages are there?","What is the practice day?","How do I care for a new piercing?","How do I sign up?","Contact"],"fallback":{"a":"Sorry, I have no answer to that. Feel free to write to us: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com or call: +49 173 8072405.","links":[{"t":"Send enquiry","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Send email","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Call","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Which modules are there?","Contact"]},"faq":[{"id":"entzuendung","q":"Is my piercing infected?","a":"Possible signs of inflammation or infection are increasing swelling, pain, warmth, strong or dark redness, pus (white, green or yellow), and fever, chills or feeling unwell. Do not take the jewellery out yourself: the hole can close and trap the infection. Only remove it if a doctor tells you to. An infection should be treated by a doctor promptly. Itching, a rash or swelling can also point to an allergic reaction.\nIf in doubt, please have it checked by a doctor.","k":["infection","infected","inflamed","inflammation","pus","redness","red","hot","warm","fever","chills","severe pain","allergy","allergic","allergic reaction","rash","itch","itchy","bump","lump"],"links":[{"t":"The Piercing Academy","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["How do I care for a new piercing?","How long does a piercing take to heal?"],"prio":true},{"id":"pflege","q":"How do I care for a new piercing?","a":"General aftercare recommendations for a new piercing:\n- wash your hands before touching it; otherwise leave it alone as much as possible\n- rinse with sterile saline (wound wash) as needed and pat dry with disposable paper\n- do not use alcohol, hydrogen peroxide, antibacterial soap, iodine or ointments\n- do not pick at crusts, do not twist or play with the jewellery\n- avoid pools, lakes and hot tubs while healing\n- keep bedding clean; for ear cartilage a travel pillow or a clean T-shirt over the pillow helps\nThe course covers this in detail in module 10 (Aftercare and wound healing problems).","k":["aftercare","care","clean","cleaning","saline","salt water","disinfect","alcohol","ointment","swimming","pool","sauna","new piercing","fresh piercing","sleep","twist"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["How long does a piercing take to heal?","Is my piercing infected?"]},{"id":"normal","q":"Normal?","a":"In the first days, slight bleeding, swelling, tenderness and bruising are normal. Later, itching, slight discolouration and a whitish-yellow fluid that crusts on the jewellery can appear. That is not pus but part of healing. A piercing heals from the outside in: even when it feels fine, the tissue inside is still fragile.","k":["normal","crust","crusty","fluid","discharge","bruise","bruising","is this normal","yellow"],"next":["How do I care for a new piercing?","Is my piercing infected?"]},{"id":"heilung","q":"How long does a piercing take to heal?","a":"Typical healing times (guide values, they vary):\n- earlobe, eyebrow, lip: 6 to 8 weeks\n- ear cartilage: 2 to 4 months\n- nostril: 2 to 8 months\n- tongue and inside the mouth: 3 to 6 weeks\n- navel: up to 9 months\n- nipple and genitals: 6 to 12 months\nKeep up the aftercare for the whole healing period. Healing times are also covered in module 10 of the course.","k":["heal","heals","healing","healed","healing time","how long","change jewellery","change jewelry"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["How do I care for a new piercing?","Is my piercing infected?"]},{"id":"schmerz","q":"Does piercing hurt?","a":"How much it hurts depends on the person and the body part. The course covers this in module 04 “Pain and anaesthesia”: how pain arises and is transmitted, local anaesthesia and its limits, cooling spray and lidocaine cream with side effects and interactions.","k":["hurt","hurts","pain","painful","anaesthesia","anesthesia","numbing","lidocaine","cooling spray","emla"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"material","q":"Which jewellery, which material?","a":"The site says: initial jewellery only in titanium G23 or PTFE. In the course, module 06 “Materials and jewellery” covers titanium G23, blackline and zircon, gold, surgical steel, recognising a nickel allergy, PTFE, jewellery shapes and extra length for initial jewellery.","k":["jewellery","jewelry","material","titanium","surgical steel","steel","gold","nickel","nickel allergy","ptfe","initial jewellery","ring","stud","labret","barbell"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["How do I care for a new piercing?","Which modules are there?"]},{"id":"pakete","q":"Which packages are there?","a":"There are three packages:\n- Basic (Online course): €249 incl. VAT. Knowledge first, or you already work in a studio.\n- Practice (Online course + practice day): €999 incl. VAT. Really learn to pierce, on real people. Our recommendation.\n- Complete (With 1:1 coaching): €2,490 incl. VAT. Personal guidance until you work confidently. 10 places to start with.\nAll prices are final prices in euros including VAT. Participants must be 18 or older.","k":["package","packages","price","prices","cost","costs","euro","offer","expensive","cheap","fee"],"links":[{"t":"See packages","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Basic","Practice","Complete","Course book"]},{"id":"p-basis","q":"Package Basic","a":"Package Basic (Online course): €249 incl. VAT\nKnowledge first, or you already work in a studio.\n- All 11 modules\n- Questions, checklists, final test\n- Course book online, translated into English\n- Certificate of participation\n- Practice tasks with a materials list and shopping links","k":["Basic","package Basic","cost","costs","price","only online","theory only","beginner"],"links":[{"t":"Basic enquire","h":"index.html?paket=basis#kontakt"},{"t":"All packages","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","What is the practice day?","How do I sign up?"]},{"id":"p-praxis","q":"Package Practice","a":"Package Practice (Online course + practice day): €999 incl. VAT\nReally learn to pierce, on real people.\n- Everything in Basic\n- 1 practice day in Lingen (in German or English)\n- Real models","k":["Practice","package Practice","cost","costs","price","recommendation"],"links":[{"t":"Practice enquire","h":"index.html?paket=praxis#kontakt"},{"t":"All packages","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","What is the practice day?","How do I sign up?"]},{"id":"p-komplett","q":"Package Complete","a":"Package Complete (With 1:1 coaching): €2,490 incl. VAT\nPersonal guidance until you work confidently. 10 places to start with.\n- Everything in Practice\n- 1:1 coaching (in German or English)\n- 2 practice days in Lingen\n- Practice materials for home, by mail\n- 12 months of support","k":["Complete","package Complete","cost","costs","price","coaching","1 1 coaching","support","practice material"],"links":[{"t":"Complete enquire","h":"index.html?paket=komplett#kontakt"},{"t":"All packages","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","What is the practice day?","How do I sign up?"]},{"id":"kursbuch","q":"Course book","a":"The course book is also available on its own:\n- Course book digital: €19.90 incl. VAT. “Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer”, read online in an English translation with the German original page alongside. Included in every course package. 120 pages, from hygiene to data sheets, Read online, with search and notes.\n- Course book softcover: €39.99 incl. VAT. The same course book as a paperback, in German. Ordered and shipped through Amazon. 120 pages, softcover, epubli, 2024, ISBN 978-3-8187-5668-0, To keep at hand in the studio.\nThe course book “Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer” by Alessandro Noto is included in every package. You read it online in the course, translated into English, and can switch to the German original page at any time.","k":["course book","book","books","softcover","paperback","digital","ebook","e book","amazon","isbn","read"],"links":[{"t":"Enquire about the digital course book","h":"index.html?paket=buch#kontakt"},{"t":"Softcover on Amazon","h":"https://www.amazon.de/dp/3818756686"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"praxistag","q":"What is the practice day?","a":"The practice day is a day in the studio in Lingen (Ems), Germany. You do as many different piercings as possible, always under supervision. Bring your own models, or the studio looks for some for you. We cannot guarantee this, though.\nDates: Dates by arrangement · in German or English.\nSafety first. Every model is an adult and signs a consent form in advance. We work according to the studio’s hygiene plan.\nKnowing the technique is not the same as supervised practice. The online course teaches the knowledge; you only pierce here, under supervision. Do not pierce anyone on your own after the online course.\nSteps:\n- Hygiene and preparation: Hand disinfection, workstation, instruments.\n- Consultation and consent: Clarify wishes, ease fears.\n- Check and mark the spot: Choose the initial jewelry, mark entry and exit.\n- The piercing under supervision: Place the clamp, guide the needle, insert the jewelry.\n- Aftercare: Aftercare instructions verbally and in writing.\nPractice days are included in the Practice (1 day) and Complete (2 days) packages.","k":["practice day","practice days","studio","lingen","in person","real models","model","models","pierce","practise","practice","date","dates","when","where","alone","supervision"],"links":[{"t":"Practice day","h":"index.html#praxistag"},{"t":"Ask for a date","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["Can I bring my own model to the practice day?","Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"onlinekurs","q":"How does the online course work?","a":"The online course: Modules: 11, Lessons: 103, Questions: 575, Access: 12 months.\nHow you learn:\n- Content first: Key points, tables, photos from the course book and graphics drawn especially for the course.\n- Then the questions: One at a time, with instant feedback. Wrong answers come back.\n- Then the next lesson: It only opens once you have mastered all the questions.\n- Module exam: 20 random questions, pass mark 80 percent. For hygiene and emergencies, 85 percent.\n- Mistake training: Everything you got wrong comes back until you have answered it correctly twice.\n- Mock final exam: 50 questions from all modules. For hygiene and emergencies, at most one mistake is allowed.\n- Learn wherever you like: On your phone, tablet or computer. Access for 12 months from activation.\n- Course book included: The basis of the theory, included in every package, translated into English.\n- Final test and certificate: After the final test you receive a certificate of participation from the academy. Not a state qualification.\nThe online course does not replace hands-on supervision. It teaches the knowledge. You only pierce on the practice day, under supervision. Do not pierce anyone on your own after the online course.","k":["online course","online","course","learn","lessons","exam","exams","module exam","final test","test","access","phone","tablet","computer","own pace","duration"],"links":[{"t":"Online course","h":"online-kurs.html"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"module","q":"Which modules are there?","a":"The course has 11 modules:\n- 01 The profession and its history\n- 02 Law, liability, consent\n- 03 Anatomy, skin and wound healing\n- 04 Pain and anesthesia\n- 05 Hygiene and sterile working\n- 06 Materials and jewelry\n- 07 Tools and instruments\n- 08 Types of piercing\n- 09 Procedure, consultation, emergencies\n- 10 Aftercare and healing problems\n- 11 Starting a studio\nName a topic or a module number and I will tell you more.","k":["modules","module","course content","content","topics","topic","curriculum","syllabus"],"links":[{"t":"All modules","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Hygiene and sterile working","Types of piercing","Starting a studio"]},{"id":"m-01","q":"Module 01: The profession and its history","a":"Module 01: The profession and its history\nYou know what piercing is, where it comes from, how professionals pierce today and why the piercing gun has no place in a studio.\nLessons:\n- What piercing is\n- Early traces: Africa and Egypt\n- Europe, antiquity and other cultures\n- How piercing is done today\n- Hygiene, aftercare and healing\n- Why no piercing gun\n- Preparing the client\n7 lessons · 34 questions · module exam","k":["module 01","module 1","The profession and its history","The profession","its history"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-02","q":"Module 02: Law, liability, consent","a":"Module 02: Law, liability, consent\nYou know why every piercing needs consent, what goes into the consent form and which limits you respect as a piercer (based on German law).\nLessons:\n- Piercing is bodily harm\n- What the Criminal Code says\n- Hair, liability and damages\n- Age and minors\n- Structuring the consent form\n- Informing about complications\n- Photos and data protection\n- Health claims and advertising\n8 lessons · 38 questions · module exam","k":["module 02","module 2","Law, liability, consent","Law","liability","consent"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-03","q":"Module 03: Anatomy, skin and wound healing","a":"Module 03: Anatomy, skin and wound healing (new, goes beyond the course book)\nYou understand which tissues a piercing channel passes through, why cartilage heals more slowly than an earlobe and where blood vessels and nerves pose a risk.\nLessons:\n- The structure of the skin\n- Cartilage, soft tissue and mucous membrane\n- Risk zones on the face\n- Nerves, artery and salivary duct in the face\n- Recognizing vessels, avoiding erectile tissue\n- The phases of wound healing\n- Who heals more poorly\n7 lessons · 41 questions · module exam","k":["module 03","module 3","Anatomy, skin and wound healing","Anatomy","skin","wound healing"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-04","q":"Module 04: Pain and anesthesia","a":"Module 04: Pain and anesthesia\nYou understand how pain arises and travels, which anesthesia you may use as a piercer and what to watch out for.\nLessons:\n- “Does it hurt?”\n- Pain receptors and stimuli\n- How pain arises in tissue\n- How pain reaches the brain\n- Local anesthesia and its limits\n- Cooling spray and lidocaine ointment\n- Side effects of lidocaine\n- Interactions of lidocaine\n- Using lidocaine safely\n9 lessons · 47 questions · module exam","k":["module 04","module 4","Pain and anesthesia","Pain","anesthesia"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-05","q":"Module 05: Hygiene and sterile working","a":"Module 05: Hygiene and sterile working\nYou work as if in an operating room: correct hand hygiene, a clean, well-equipped workstation, proper disinfection, a hygiene plan and safe sterilization in the autoclave.\nLessons:\n- Hygiene measures in the piercing room\n- Aims and requirements of hand hygiene\n- Hygienic hand disinfection\n- Surgical hand disinfection\n- Wash or disinfect?\n- Hand washing\n- The hand-washing station\n- The workstation\n- Sharps disposal and face mask\n- Protection from blood contact: vaccination and needlestick injuries\n- Disinfection, sterilization and antisepsis\n- How disinfectants work\n- Types of disinfectant and the VAH list\n- Handling instruments correctly\n- The hygiene plan\n- The autoclave\n- Reprocessing and packing instruments\n- The four phases of sterilization\n- Storage and function checks\n19 lessons · 101 questions · module exam","k":["module 05","module 5","Hygiene and sterile working","Hygiene","sterile working"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-06","q":"Module 06: Materials and jewelry","a":"Module 06: Materials and jewelry\nYou know which materials are suitable as initial jewelry, recognize the common jewelry types and know the basic rule on extra length.\nLessons:\n- G23 titanium\n- Blackline and zircon gold\n- Surgical steel\n- The rule for initial jewelry\n- Recognizing nickel allergy\n- PTFE\n- How to recognize good initial jewelry\n- Jewelry types: bars and studs\n- Jewelry types: rings\n- Extra length for initial jewelry\n10 lessons · 48 questions · module exam","k":["module 06","module 6","Materials and jewelry","Materials","jewelry"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-07","q":"Module 07: Tools and instruments","a":"Module 07: Tools and instruments\nYou know a piercer’s tools, what each one is for, and which must be sterile and which only clean.\nLessons:\n- Needles (cannulas)\n- Needle gauge and jewelry gauge\n- Biopsy punches\n- Forceps, clamps and receiving tube\n- Auxiliary tools\n- Disposable supplies\n- Sterile or just clean?\n7 lessons · 41 questions · module exam","k":["module 07","module 7","Tools and instruments","Tools","instruments"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-08","q":"Module 08: Types of piercing","a":"Module 08: Types of piercing\nFor every piercing you know the placement, initial jewelry, needle and clamp, and you know which piercings to turn down as a beginner or never to do.\nLessons:\n- How to read a data sheet\n- Lobe and upper lobe\n- Tragus and anti-tragus\n- Helix, industrial and allergy piercing\n- Conch and snug\n- Rook and daith\n- Nose: nostril and septum\n- Eyebrow and bridge\n- Lip: labret, medusa and eskimo\n- Lip frenulum and tongue\n- Cheek\n- Navel\n- Nipple\n- Surface\n- Male genital area (adults only)\n- Female genital area (adults only)\n- Piercings you do not perform\n17 lessons · 124 questions · module exam","k":["module 08","module 8","Types of piercing","Types of piercing"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-09","q":"Module 09: Procedure, consultation, emergencies","a":"Module 09: Procedure, consultation, emergencies\nYou know the 26 steps from the client entering the studio to aftercare, and what to do if someone feels faint.\nLessons:\n- Welcome and consultation\n- Preparation and marking\n- The piercing\n- Securing the jewelry\n- Aftercare and finishing\n- Fainting and emergencies\n6 lessons · 49 questions · module exam","k":["module 09","module 9","Procedure, consultation, emergencies","Procedure","consultation","emergencies"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-10","q":"Module 10: Aftercare and healing problems","a":"Module 10: Aftercare and healing problems\nYou give the right aftercare instructions, know the healing times and spot healing problems before they become serious.\nLessons:\n- Teaching aftercare\n- The right aftercare products\n- Healing times\n- Failure to epithelialize and recurrent bleeding\n- Infections\n- Perichondritis: an emergency of the ear cartilage\n- Hypergranulation\n7 lessons · 35 questions · module exam","k":["module 10","module 10","Aftercare and healing problems","Aftercare","healing problems"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"m-11","q":"Module 11: Starting a studio","a":"Module 11: Starting a studio (new, goes beyond the course book)\nYou know the steps before offering piercing yourself: business registration, health authority, hygiene plan, documentation, insurance, pricing and purchasing (based on the rules in Germany).\nLessons:\n- Business registration and authorities\n- Planning the premises\n- Hygiene plan and documentation\n- Insurance and pricing\n- Purchasing\n- Rules for your studio\n6 lessons · 17 questions · module exam","k":["module 11","module 11","Starting a studio","Starting a studio"],"links":[{"t":"Course content","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Which modules are there?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"zertifikat","q":"Do I get a certificate?","a":"The Piercing Akademie certificate confirms your participation and training. It is not a state qualification.\nAfter the final test of the online course you receive a certificate of participation from the academy.","k":["certificate","certification","diploma","qualification","recognised","recognized","state","accredited","proof"],"next":["Which packages are there?","Can I open a studio after the course?"]},{"id":"zielgruppe","q":"Who is the course for?","a":"For everyone who wants to pierce professionally:\n- Beauty salons: Piercing as a new service, safe and clean.\n- Tattoo studios: You already know hygiene. Add piercing technique, jewelry and materials.\n- Your own studio: From the first piercing to registering a business, hygiene plan and purchasing.\nFor your own studio the best fit is: Complete.","k":["who is it for","target","beauty salon","cosmetic","tattoo studio","tattoo","tattoo artist","career change","suitable"],"next":["Do I need any prior knowledge?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"ausbilder","q":"Who is the trainer?","a":"Your trainer is Alessandro Noto. “I am a piercer and the owner of 740 Piercing in Lingen, Germany. At the Piercing Akademie I show you how I work in the studio every day: clean, safe and step by step.”\nyears as a piercer: 5, piercings done: Thousands, own studio: Lingen.","k":["trainer","teacher","instructor","alessandro","noto","740 piercing","experience","about you"],"links":[{"t":"Instagram @740_piercing","h":"https://www.instagram.com/740_piercing/"}],"next":["Contact"]},{"id":"leistung","q":"What do I get?","a":"What you get:\n- The knowledge of an experienced piercer, from A to Z\n- Goal: to work independently and safely afterwards\n- Buying tips for jewelry, needles and supplies\n- Clear hygiene and legal basics (based on German law)\n- Practice on silicone and on models, depending on the package","k":["get","included","include","includes","worth"],"next":["Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"faq-0","q":"Do I need any prior knowledge?","a":"No. The course starts with the basics. If you already work in a studio, you can focus on what you need.","k":["previous knowledge","experience needed","prior experience","beginner","no experience"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"faq-1","q":"How do I get access to the online course?","a":"After booking you receive your login details by email. You learn at your own pace on your phone, tablet or computer.","k":["access","login","log in","credentials"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"faq-2","q":"Can I bring my own model to the practice day?","a":"Yes. The model must be an adult and signs a consent form in advance. If you have no model, the studio looks for one for you. This usually works out, but we cannot guarantee it.","k":["own model","bring a model","bring","friend","models"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"faq-3","q":"When are the practice days?","a":"By arrangement. Tell us when suits you and we will find a date together. Practice days take place in German or English.","k":["when","dates","take place","schedule"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"faq-4","q":"Can I open a studio after the course?","a":"That is decided by your local authorities. Module 11 shows what to prepare in Germany; in other countries the local rules apply.","k":["open a studio","own studio","business","health department","permit","licence","license"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"faq-5","q":"What is the difference between Practice and Complete?","a":"Complete also includes 1:1 coaching, a second practice day, all practice materials for home by mail and one year of support.","k":["difference","practice or complete","compare"],"links":[{"t":"FAQ","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"alter","q":"What is the minimum age?","a":"You must be 18 or older to take part. Every model on the practice day is also an adult and signs in advance.","k":["age","old","years","minor","adult","16","17","18"],"next":["Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"anmeldung","q":"How do I sign up?","a":"Send us an inquiry. We will arrange the date of your practice day with you personally.\nUse the form under “Sign up” to choose your package and send us your enquiry. You can also reach us by phone (+49 173 8072405) or email (diepiercingakademie@gmail.com).\nAll prices are final prices in euros including VAT. Participants must be 18 or older.","k":["sign up","register","enrol","enroll","book","booking","order","buy","join","enquiry","apply"],"links":[{"t":"Send enquiry","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Send email","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Call","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"widerruf","q":"Withdrawal and terms","a":"The rules on the contract and withdrawal are in the terms and conditions with the withdrawal policy. The site says: “The online course starts immediately after purchase: with your consent during checkout, your right of withdrawal for the online course expires once your access is activated. Practice days and coaching take place in German or English.”\nI cannot give legal advice. If you have questions, please contact us directly.","k":["withdrawal","withdraw","cancel","cancellation","refund","money back","terms","contract"],"links":[{"t":"Terms and withdrawal","h":"agb.html#widerruf"},{"t":"Withdraw from contract","h":"widerrufen.html"}],"next":["Contact"]},{"id":"kontakt","q":"Contact","a":"The Piercing Academy\n740 Piercing, Burgstraße 12, 49808 Lingen (Ems)\nPhone: +49 173 8072405\nE-Mail: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com\nInstagram: @diepiercingakademie","k":["contact","reach","phone","call","number","email","e mail","mail","address","instagram","message","write","whatsapp","location"],"links":[{"t":"Send enquiry","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Send email","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Call","h":"tel:+491738072405"},{"t":"Instagram","h":"https://www.instagram.com/diepiercingakademie/"}],"next":["How do I sign up?","Which packages are there?"]},{"id":"recht","q":"Legal notice and privacy","a":"All legal details are in the legal notice, and everything about your data is in the privacy policy.","k":["legal notice","imprint","privacy","gdpr","owner","legal"],"links":[{"t":"Legal notice","h":"impressum.html"},{"t":"Privacy","h":"datenschutz.html"},{"t":"Terms and withdrawal","h":"agb.html"}],"next":["Contact"]},{"id":"bot","q":"Who are you?","a":"I am an automated assistant. I run only in your browser, use no cookies and do not store or send what you type. I answer with information from this website and general knowledge, but I do not replace personal, medical or legal advice.","k":["who are you","bot","chatbot","assistant","ai","human","stored","cookies"],"next":["Which packages are there?","Contact"]},{"id":"danke","q":"Thanks","a":"You are welcome! Feel free to ask more.","k":["thanks","thank","great","perfect","bye"]}]},"es":{"titel":"Academia de Piercing · Asistente","begruessung":"¡Hola! Soy el asistente automático de la Academia de Piercing. Pregúntame por los paquetes y precios, el curso online, los días de práctica en Lingen, el cuidado y la cicatrización o cómo contactarnos.","relativZu":"seite","vorschlaege":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Qué es el día de práctica?","¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","¿Cómo me inscribo?","Contacto"],"fallback":{"a":"Lo siento, no tengo respuesta para eso. Escríbenos: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com o llama: +49 173 8072405.","links":[{"t":"Enviar solicitud","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Escribir correo","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Llamar","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Qué módulos hay?","Contacto"]},"faq":[{"id":"entzuendung","q":"¿Está infectado mi piercing?","a":"Posibles signos de inflamación o infección son hinchazón creciente, dolor, calor, enrojecimiento fuerte u oscuro, pus (blanco, verde o amarillo) y fiebre, escalofríos o malestar. No te quites la joya por tu cuenta: el orificio puede cerrarse y encerrar la infección. Quítala solo si te lo indica un médico. Una infección debe tratarla un médico con rapidez. Picor, sarpullido o hinchazón también pueden indicar una reacción alérgica.\nAnte la duda, consulta a un médico.","k":["infeccion","infectado","inflamado","inflamacion","pus","enrojecimiento","rojo","caliente","fiebre","escalofrios","dolor fuerte","alergia","alergico","reaccion alergica","sarpullido","pica","picor","bulto"],"links":[{"t":"La Academia de Piercing","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","¿Cuánto tarda en cicatrizar un piercing?"],"prio":true},{"id":"pflege","q":"¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","a":"Recomendaciones generales para cuidar un piercing nuevo:\n- lávate las manos antes de tocarlo; por lo demás, déjalo tranquilo\n- enjuágalo cuando haga falta con suero fisiológico estéril (solución para lavar heridas) y sécalo con papel desechable\n- no uses alcohol, agua oxigenada, jabón antibacteriano, yodo ni pomadas\n- no arranques las costras ni gires o juegues con la joya\n- evita piscinas, lagos y jacuzzis mientras cicatriza\n- mantén limpia la ropa de cama; para el cartílago de la oreja ayuda una almohada de viaje o una camiseta limpia sobre la almohada\nEl curso lo trata en detalle en el módulo 10.","k":["cuidado","cuidados","cuidar","limpiar","limpieza","suero","suero fisiologico","agua con sal","desinfectar","alcohol","pomada","nadar","piscina","sauna","piercing nuevo","dormir","girar"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Cuánto tarda en cicatrizar un piercing?","¿Está infectado mi piercing?"]},{"id":"normal","q":"¿Es normal?","a":"En los primeros días es normal un ligero sangrado, hinchazón, sensibilidad y algún moratón. Después pueden aparecer picor, una ligera decoloración y un líquido blanco-amarillento que forma costra en la joya. No es pus, forma parte de la cicatrización. Un piercing cicatriza de fuera hacia dentro: aunque parezca curado, el tejido interior sigue siendo frágil.","k":["normal","costra","costras","liquido","secrecion","moraton","es normal","amarillo"],"next":["¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","¿Está infectado mi piercing?"]},{"id":"heilung","q":"¿Cuánto tarda en cicatrizar un piercing?","a":"Tiempos de cicatrización habituales (orientativos, varían):\n- lóbulo, ceja, labio: 6 a 8 semanas\n- cartílago de la oreja: 2 a 4 meses\n- aleta de la nariz: 2 a 8 meses\n- lengua e interior de la boca: 3 a 6 semanas\n- ombligo: hasta 9 meses\n- pezón y zona íntima: 6 a 12 meses\nSigue con los cuidados durante toda la cicatrización. El módulo 10 del curso también trata los tiempos de cicatrización.","k":["cicatriza","cicatrizar","cicatrizacion","curar","curado","tarda","tardar","cambiar joya"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","¿Está infectado mi piercing?"]},{"id":"schmerz","q":"¿Duele hacerse un piercing?","a":"Cuánto duele depende de la persona y de la zona. El curso lo trata en el módulo 04 «Dolor y anestesia»: cómo surge y se transmite el dolor, la anestesia local y sus límites, el spray frío y la crema de lidocaína con efectos secundarios e interacciones.","k":["duele","dolor","doloroso","anestesia","anestesiar","lidocaina","spray frio","emla"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"material","q":"¿Qué joya, qué material?","a":"Según la página: joya inicial solo de titanio G23 o PTFE. En el curso, el módulo 06 «Material y joyas» trata, entre otros, el titanio G23, blackline y circonio, oro, acero quirúrgico, cómo reconocer una alergia al níquel, PTFE, formas de joyas y largo extra en la joya inicial.","k":["joya","joyas","material","titanio","acero quirurgico","acero","oro","niquel","alergia al niquel","ptfe","joya inicial","aro","labret","barbell"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Cómo cuido un piercing nuevo?","¿Qué módulos hay?"]},{"id":"pakete","q":"¿Qué paquetes hay?","a":"Hay tres paquetes:\n- Básico (Curso online): 249 € IVA incl. Primero el conocimiento, o ya trabajas en un estudio.\n- Práctica (Curso online + día de práctica): 999 € IVA incl. Aprende de verdad a perforar, con personas reales. Nuestra recomendación.\n- Completo (Con mentoría 1:1): 2.490 € IVA incl. Acompañamiento personal hasta que trabajes con seguridad. De momento, 10 plazas.\nTodos los precios son finales, en euros e IVA incluido. Participación a partir de 18 años.","k":["paquete","paquetes","precio","precios","coste","cuesta","cuestan","euro","euros","oferta","caro","barato","tarifa"],"links":[{"t":"Ver paquetes","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["Básico","Práctica","Completo","Libro del curso"]},{"id":"p-basis","q":"Paquete Básico","a":"Paquete Básico (Curso online): 249 € IVA incl\nPrimero el conocimiento, o ya trabajas en un estudio.\n- Los 11 módulos\n- Preguntas, listas de control, examen final\n- Libro del curso online, traducido al español\n- Certificado de participación\n- Tareas prácticas con lista de material y enlaces de compra","k":["Básico","paquete Básico","cuesta","precio","coste","solo online","solo teoria","principiante"],"links":[{"t":"Básico solicitar","h":"index.html?paket=basis#kontakt"},{"t":"Todos los paquetes","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Qué es el día de práctica?","¿Cómo me inscribo?"]},{"id":"p-praxis","q":"Paquete Práctica","a":"Paquete Práctica (Curso online + día de práctica): 999 € IVA incl\nAprende de verdad a perforar, con personas reales.\n- Todo lo de Básico\n- 1 día de práctica en Lingen (en alemán o inglés)\n- Modelos reales","k":["Práctica","paquete Práctica","cuesta","precio","coste","recomendacion"],"links":[{"t":"Práctica solicitar","h":"index.html?paket=praxis#kontakt"},{"t":"Todos los paquetes","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Qué es el día de práctica?","¿Cómo me inscribo?"]},{"id":"p-komplett","q":"Paquete Completo","a":"Paquete Completo (Con mentoría 1:1): 2.490 € IVA incl\nAcompañamiento personal hasta que trabajes con seguridad. De momento, 10 plazas.\n- Todo lo de Práctica\n- Mentoría 1:1 (en alemán o inglés)\n- 2 días de práctica en Lingen\n- Material de práctica para casa, por correo\n- 12 meses de soporte","k":["Completo","paquete Completo","cuesta","precio","coste","coaching","1 1 coaching","soporte","material de practica"],"links":[{"t":"Completo solicitar","h":"index.html?paket=komplett#kontakt"},{"t":"Todos los paquetes","h":"index.html#pakete"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Qué es el día de práctica?","¿Cómo me inscribo?"]},{"id":"kursbuch","q":"Libro del curso","a":"El libro del curso también se vende por separado:\n- Libro del curso digital: 19,90 € IVA incl. «Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer», para leer online traducido al español, con la página original en alemán a un clic. Incluido en todos los paquetes del curso. 120 páginas, de la higiene a las fichas técnicas, Lectura online, con búsqueda y notas.\n- Libro del curso en tapa blanda: 39,99 € IVA incl. El mismo libro del curso en tapa blanda, en alemán. Pedido y envío a través de Amazon. 120 páginas, tapa blanda, epubli, 2024, ISBN 978-3-8187-5668-0, Para tenerlo a mano en el estudio.\nEl libro del curso «Die Piercing Akademie – Dein Weg zum Bodypiercer» de Alessandro Noto está incluido en todos los paquetes. Lo lees online en el curso, traducido al español, y puedes ver la página original en alemán cuando quieras.","k":["libro","libro del curso","libros","tapa blanda","digital","ebook","amazon","isbn","leer"],"links":[{"t":"Solicitar libro digital","h":"index.html?paket=buch#kontakt"},{"t":"Tapa blanda en Amazon","h":"https://www.amazon.de/dp/3818756686"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"praxistag","q":"¿Qué es el día de práctica?","a":"El día de práctica es un día en el estudio de Lingen (Ems), Alemania. Haces tantos piercings distintos como sea posible, siempre bajo supervisión. Puedes traer tus propios modelos o el estudio te busca algunos, aunque no podemos garantizarlo.\nFechas: Fechas a convenir · en alemán o inglés.\nLa seguridad, lo primero. Cada modelo es mayor de edad y firma antes un consentimiento. Se trabaja según el plan de higiene del estudio.\nConocer la técnica no sustituye la práctica supervisada. El curso online transmite los conocimientos; solo se perfora aquí, bajo supervisión. No perfores a nadie por tu cuenta después del curso online.\nPasos:\n- Higiene y preparación: Desinfección de manos, puesto de trabajo, instrumentos.\n- Consulta y consentimiento: Aclarar deseos, quitar miedos.\n- Revisar y marcar la zona: Elegir la joya inicial, marcar entrada y salida.\n- La perforación bajo supervisión: Colocar la pinza, guiar la aguja, insertar la joya.\n- Cuidados posteriores: Instrucciones de cuidado de palabra y por escrito.\nLos días de práctica están en los paquetes Práctica (1 día) y Completo (2 días).","k":["dia de practica","dias de practica","practica","estudio","lingen","presencial","modelos reales","modelo","modelos","perforar","fecha","fechas","cuando","donde","solo","sola","supervision"],"links":[{"t":"Día de práctica","h":"index.html#praxistag"},{"t":"Pedir fecha","h":"index.html#kontakt"}],"next":["¿Puedo traer mi propio modelo al día de práctica?","¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"onlinekurs","q":"¿Cómo funciona el curso online?","a":"El curso online: Módulos: 11, Lecciones: 103, Preguntas: 575, Acceso: 12 meses.\nAsí aprendes:\n- Primero el contenido: Ideas clave, tablas, fotos del libro y gráficos dibujados para el curso.\n- Luego las preguntas: Una a una, con respuesta inmediata. Las falladas vuelven a salir.\n- Luego la siguiente lección: Solo se abre cuando dominas todas las preguntas.\n- Examen del módulo: 20 preguntas al azar, se aprueba con un 80 %. En higiene y emergencias, con un 85 %.\n- Repaso de errores: Todo lo que hayas fallado vuelve hasta que lo respondas bien dos veces.\n- Simulacro de examen: 50 preguntas de todos los módulos. En higiene y emergencias se permite como máximo un error.\n- Aprende donde quieras: En el móvil, la tableta o el ordenador. Acceso durante 12 meses desde la activación.\n- Con libro del curso: La base de la teoría, incluido en todos los paquetes, traducido al español.\n- Examen final y certificado: Tras el examen final recibes un certificado de participación de la academia. No es un título oficial.\nEl curso online no sustituye la formación práctica supervisada. Transmite los conocimientos. Solo se perfora en el día de práctica, bajo supervisión. No perfores a nadie por tu cuenta después del curso online.","k":["curso online","online","curso","aprender","lecciones","examen","examenes","prueba","acceso","movil","tableta","ordenador","propio ritmo","duracion"],"links":[{"t":"Curso online","h":"online-kurs.html"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"module","q":"¿Qué módulos hay?","a":"El curso tiene 11 módulos:\n- 01 La profesión y su historia\n- 02 Normativa, responsabilidad, consentimiento\n- 03 Anatomía, piel y cicatrización\n- 04 Dolor y anestesia\n- 05 Higiene y trabajo estéril\n- 06 Materiales y joyas\n- 07 Herramientas e instrumentos\n- 08 Tipos de piercing\n- 09 Procedimiento, consulta, emergencias\n- 10 Cuidados y problemas de cicatrización\n- 11 Abrir un estudio\nDime un tema o un número de módulo y te cuento más.","k":["modulos","modulo","contenido","contenidos","temas","tema","temario","programa"],"links":[{"t":"Todos los módulos","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["Higiene y trabajo estéril","Tipos de piercing","Abrir un estudio"]},{"id":"m-01","q":"Módulo 01: La profesión y su historia","a":"Módulo 01: La profesión y su historia\nSabes qué es el piercing, de dónde viene, cómo se perfora hoy de forma profesional y por qué la pistola no tiene cabida en un estudio.\nLecciones:\n- Qué es el piercing\n- Primeras huellas: África y Egipto\n- Europa, la Antigüedad y otras culturas\n- Cómo se perfora hoy\n- Higiene, cuidados y curación\n- Por qué no usar pistola\n- Preparar al cliente\n7 lecciones · 34 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 01","módulo 1","La profesión y su historia","La profesión","su historia"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-02","q":"Módulo 02: Normativa, responsabilidad, consentimiento","a":"Módulo 02: Normativa, responsabilidad, consentimiento\nSabes por qué cada piercing necesita consentimiento, qué debe incluir el formulario de consentimiento y qué límites respetas como perforador (según la ley alemana).\nLecciones:\n- Perforar es una lesión corporal\n- Qué dice el Código Penal\n- Vello, responsabilidad e indemnización\n- Edad y menores\n- Cómo estructurar el consentimiento\n- Informar sobre complicaciones\n- Fotos y protección de datos\n- Promesas de curación y publicidad\n8 lecciones · 38 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 02","módulo 2","Normativa, responsabilidad, consentimiento","Normativa","responsabilidad","consentimiento"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-03","q":"Módulo 03: Anatomía, piel y cicatrización","a":"Módulo 03: Anatomía, piel y cicatrización (nuevo, va más allá del libro)\nEntiendes qué tejidos atraviesa el canal de una perforación, por qué el cartílago cura más despacio que el lóbulo y dónde los vasos y nervios son un riesgo.\nLecciones:\n- La estructura de la piel\n- Cartílago, tejido blando y mucosa\n- Zonas de riesgo en la cara\n- Nervios, arteria y conducto salival en la cara\n- Reconocer vasos, evitar el tejido eréctil\n- Las fases de la cicatrización\n- Quién cura peor\n7 lecciones · 41 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 03","módulo 3","Anatomía, piel y cicatrización","Anatomía","piel","cicatrización"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-04","q":"Módulo 04: Dolor y anestesia","a":"Módulo 04: Dolor y anestesia\nEntiendes cómo surge y se transmite el dolor, qué anestesia puedes usar como perforador y qué debes tener en cuenta.\nLecciones:\n- «¿Duele?»\n- Receptores del dolor y estímulos\n- Cómo surge el dolor en el tejido\n- Cómo llega el dolor al cerebro\n- La anestesia local y sus límites\n- Espray frío y pomada de lidocaína\n- Efectos secundarios de la lidocaína\n- Interacciones de la lidocaína\n- Usar la lidocaína con seguridad\n9 lecciones · 47 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 04","módulo 4","Dolor y anestesia","Dolor","anestesia"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-05","q":"Módulo 05: Higiene y trabajo estéril","a":"Módulo 05: Higiene y trabajo estéril\nTrabajas como en un quirófano: higiene de manos correcta, puesto de trabajo limpio y bien equipado, desinfección adecuada, plan de higiene y esterilización segura en autoclave.\nLecciones:\n- Medidas de higiene en la sala de piercing\n- Objetivos y requisitos de la higiene de manos\n- Desinfección higiénica de manos\n- Desinfección quirúrgica de manos\n- ¿Lavar o desinfectar?\n- El lavado de manos\n- El lavamanos\n- El puesto de trabajo\n- Contenedor de agujas y mascarilla\n- Protección frente a la sangre: vacunación y pinchazos\n- Desinfección, esterilización y antisepsia\n- Cómo actúan los desinfectantes\n- Tipos de desinfectante y la lista VAH\n- Tratar bien los instrumentos\n- El plan de higiene\n- El autoclave\n- Reprocesar y empaquetar el instrumental\n- Las cuatro fases de la esterilización\n- Almacenamiento y control de funcionamiento\n19 lecciones · 101 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 05","módulo 5","Higiene y trabajo estéril","Higiene","trabajo estéril"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-06","q":"Módulo 06: Materiales y joyas","a":"Módulo 06: Materiales y joyas\nSabes qué materiales sirven como joya inicial, reconoces los tipos de joya habituales y conoces la regla básica del largo extra.\nLecciones:\n- Titanio G23\n- Blackline y oro circonio\n- Acero quirúrgico\n- La regla de la joya inicial\n- Reconocer la alergia al níquel\n- PTFE\n- Cómo reconocer una buena joya inicial\n- Tipos de joya: barras y labrets\n- Tipos de joya: aros\n- Largo extra de la joya inicial\n10 lecciones · 48 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 06","módulo 6","Materiales y joyas","Materiales","joyas"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-07","q":"Módulo 07: Herramientas e instrumentos","a":"Módulo 07: Herramientas e instrumentos\nConoces las herramientas del perforador, para qué sirve cada una y cuáles deben estar estériles y cuáles solo limpias.\nLecciones:\n- Agujas (cánulas)\n- Calibre de aguja y calibre de joya\n- Sacabocados de biopsia\n- Pinzas, clamps y tubo receptor\n- Herramientas auxiliares\n- Material desechable\n- ¿Estéril o solo limpio?\n7 lecciones · 41 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 07","módulo 7","Herramientas e instrumentos","Herramientas e instrumentos"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-08","q":"Módulo 08: Tipos de piercing","a":"Módulo 08: Tipos de piercing\nDe cada piercing conoces la ubicación, la joya inicial, la aguja y la pinza, y sabes qué piercings rechazas como principiante o no haces nunca.\nLecciones:\n- Cómo leer una ficha\n- Lóbulo y lóbulo superior\n- Trago y antitrago\n- Hélix, industrial y piercing para alergias\n- Conch y snug\n- Rook y daith\n- Nariz: nostril y septum\n- Ceja y bridge\n- Labio: labret, medusa y esquimal\n- Frenillo labial y lengua\n- Mejilla\n- Ombligo\n- Pezón\n- Surface\n- Zona íntima masculina (solo para adultos)\n- Zona íntima femenina (solo para adultos)\n- Piercings que no haces\n17 lecciones · 124 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 08","módulo 8","Tipos de piercing","Tipos de piercing"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-09","q":"Módulo 09: Procedimiento, consulta, emergencias","a":"Módulo 09: Procedimiento, consulta, emergencias\nConoces los 26 pasos desde que el cliente entra en el estudio hasta los cuidados posteriores, y sabes qué hacer si alguien se marea.\nLecciones:\n- Recepción y consulta\n- Preparación y marcado\n- La perforación\n- Asegurar la joya\n- Cuidados y cierre\n- Mareos y emergencias\n6 lecciones · 49 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 09","módulo 9","Procedimiento, consulta, emergencias","Procedimiento","consulta","emergencias"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-10","q":"Módulo 10: Cuidados y problemas de cicatrización","a":"Módulo 10: Cuidados y problemas de cicatrización\nDas las instrucciones de cuidado correctas, conoces los tiempos de curación y detectas los problemas de cicatrización antes de que se agraven.\nLecciones:\n- Explicar los cuidados\n- Los productos de cuidado adecuados\n- Tiempos de curación\n- Falta de epitelización y sangrado posterior\n- Infecciones\n- Pericondritis: urgencia en el cartílago de la oreja\n- Hipergranulación\n7 lecciones · 35 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 10","módulo 10","Cuidados y problemas de cicatrización","Cuidados","problemas de cicatrización"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"m-11","q":"Módulo 11: Abrir un estudio","a":"Módulo 11: Abrir un estudio (nuevo, va más allá del libro)\nSabes qué pasos dar antes de ofrecer piercings por tu cuenta: registro del negocio, autoridad sanitaria, plan de higiene, documentación, seguro, precios y compras (según la normativa alemana).\nLecciones:\n- Registro y autoridades\n- Planificar el local\n- Plan de higiene y documentación\n- Seguro y precios\n- Compras\n- Normas para tu estudio\n6 lecciones · 17 preguntas · examen del módulo","k":["módulo 11","módulo 11","Abrir un estudio","Abrir un estudio"],"links":[{"t":"Contenido del curso","h":"online-kurs.html#module"}],"next":["¿Qué módulos hay?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"zertifikat","q":"¿Recibo un certificado?","a":"El certificado de la Piercing Akademie confirma tu participación y tu formación. No es un título oficial.\nTras el examen final del curso online recibes un certificado de participación de la academia.","k":["certificado","titulo","diploma","acreditado","oficial","reconocido","cualificacion"],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","¿Puedo abrir un estudio después del curso?"]},{"id":"zielgruppe","q":"¿Para quién es el curso?","a":"Para todas las personas que quieren perforar de forma profesional:\n- Centros de estética: El piercing como nuevo servicio, seguro y limpio.\n- Estudios de tatuaje: La higiene ya la conoces. Ahora suma la técnica, las joyas y los materiales.\n- Tu propio estudio: Desde la primera perforación hasta el registro del negocio, el plan de higiene y las compras.\nPara un estudio propio lo mejor es: Completo.","k":["para quien","centro de estetica","estetica","estudio de tatuajes","tatuaje","tatuador","adecuado"],"next":["¿Necesito conocimientos previos?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"ausbilder","q":"¿Quién es el formador?","a":"Tu formador es Alessandro Noto. “Soy perforador y propietario de 740 Piercing en Lingen (Alemania). En la Piercing Akademie te enseño cómo trabajo cada día en el estudio: limpio, seguro y paso a paso.”\naños como perforador: 5, piercings realizados: Miles, estudio propio: Lingen.","k":["formador","profesor","instructor","alessandro","noto","740 piercing","experiencia","sobre ti"],"links":[{"t":"Instagram @740_piercing","h":"https://www.instagram.com/740_piercing/"}],"next":["Contacto"]},{"id":"leistung","q":"¿Qué recibo?","a":"Esto recibes:\n- El conocimiento de un perforador con experiencia, de la A a la Z\n- Objetivo: trabajar después de forma autónoma y segura\n- Consejos de compra para joyas, agujas y material\n- Bases claras de higiene y normativa (según la ley alemana)\n- Práctica con silicona y con modelos, según el paquete","k":["recibo","incluye","incluido","incluidos","merece"],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"faq-0","q":"¿Necesito conocimientos previos?","a":"No. El curso empieza por lo básico. Si ya trabajas en un estudio, puedes repasar lo que necesites.","k":["conocimientos previos","experiencia previa","sin experiencia","principiante"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"faq-1","q":"¿Cómo accedo al curso online?","a":"Tras la reserva recibes tus datos de acceso por correo electrónico. Aprendes a tu ritmo en el móvil, la tableta o el ordenador.","k":["acceso","datos de acceso","login","entrar"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"faq-2","q":"¿Puedo traer mi propio modelo al día de práctica?","a":"Sí. El modelo debe ser mayor de edad y firma antes un consentimiento. Si no tienes modelo, el estudio te busca uno. Normalmente sale bien, pero no podemos garantizarlo.","k":["propio modelo","traer modelo","traer","amiga","amigo","modelos"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"faq-3","q":"¿Cuándo son los días de práctica?","a":"A convenir. Dinos qué fechas te vienen bien y buscamos juntos un día. Los días de práctica se imparten en alemán o inglés.","k":["cuando","fechas","tienen lugar","calendario"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"faq-4","q":"¿Puedo abrir un estudio después del curso?","a":"Lo deciden las autoridades de tu localidad. El módulo 11 muestra qué preparar en Alemania; en otros países rigen las normas locales.","k":["abrir estudio","estudio propio","negocio","licencia","permiso","sanidad"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"faq-5","q":"¿Qué diferencia hay entre Práctica y Completo?","a":"Completo incluye además mentoría 1:1, un segundo día de práctica, todo el material de práctica para casa por correo y un año de soporte.","k":["diferencia","practica o completo","comparar"],"links":[{"t":"Preguntas frecuentes","h":"index.html#faq"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"alter","q":"¿A partir de qué edad?","a":"Se puede participar a partir de 18 años. Cada modelo del día de práctica también es mayor de edad y firma antes.","k":["edad","anos","menor","mayor de edad","16","17","18"],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"anmeldung","q":"¿Cómo me inscribo?","a":"Envíanos una consulta. La fecha de tu día de práctica la acordamos contigo personalmente.\nEn el formulario de “Inscripción” eliges tu paquete y nos envías tu solicitud. También puedes llamarnos (+49 173 8072405) o escribirnos (diepiercingakademie@gmail.com).\nTodos los precios son finales, en euros e IVA incluido. Participación a partir de 18 años.","k":["inscribirme","inscribir","inscripcion","apuntarme","reservar","reserva","comprar","pedido","solicitud","registrar"],"links":[{"t":"Enviar solicitud","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Escribir correo","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Llamar","h":"tel:+491738072405"}],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"widerruf","q":"Desistimiento y condiciones","a":"Las reglas sobre el contrato y el desistimiento están en las condiciones generales. En la página se dice: «El curso online empieza en cuanto lo compras: con tu consentimiento durante la compra, el derecho de desistimiento del curso online se extingue al activarse tu acceso. Los días de práctica y la mentoría se imparten en alemán o inglés.»\nNo puedo dar asesoramiento jurídico. Si tienes dudas, contáctanos directamente.","k":["desistimiento","desistir","cancelar","cancelacion","devolucion","reembolso","condiciones","contrato"],"links":[{"t":"Condiciones y desistimiento","h":"agb.html#widerruf"},{"t":"Desistir del contrato","h":"widerrufen.html"}],"next":["Contacto"]},{"id":"kontakt","q":"Contacto","a":"La Academia de Piercing\n740 Piercing, Burgstraße 12, 49808 Lingen (Ems)\nTeléfono: +49 173 8072405\nE-Mail: diepiercingakademie@gmail.com\nInstagram: @diepiercingakademie","k":["contacto","contactar","telefono","llamar","numero","correo","email","e mail","direccion","instagram","mensaje","escribir","whatsapp","ubicacion"],"links":[{"t":"Enviar solicitud","h":"index.html#kontakt"},{"t":"Escribir correo","h":"mailto:diepiercingakademie@gmail.com"},{"t":"Llamar","h":"tel:+491738072405"},{"t":"Instagram","h":"https://www.instagram.com/diepiercingakademie/"}],"next":["¿Cómo me inscribo?","¿Qué paquetes hay?"]},{"id":"recht","q":"Aviso legal y privacidad","a":"Todos los datos legales están en el aviso legal y todo sobre tus datos en la política de privacidad.","k":["aviso legal","privacidad","proteccion de datos","rgpd","titular","legal"],"links":[{"t":"Aviso legal","h":"impressum.html"},{"t":"Privacidad","h":"datenschutz.html"},{"t":"Condiciones y desistimiento","h":"agb.html"}],"next":["Contacto"]},{"id":"bot","q":"¿Quién eres?","a":"Soy un asistente automático. Funciono solo en tu navegador, no uso cookies y no guardo ni envío lo que escribes. Respondo con la información de esta web y conocimientos generales, pero no sustituyo el asesoramiento personal, médico ni jurídico.","k":["quien eres","bot","chatbot","asistente","ia","humano","guardas","cookies"],"next":["¿Qué paquetes hay?","Contacto"]},{"id":"danke","q":"Gracias","a":"¡De nada! Si quieres saber algo más, pregunta.","k":["gracias","genial","perfecto","adios"]}]}}};
